& Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","review_id":"68zmVhLT35p5W7eoXtV7eA","date":"2017-04-26T18:18:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430388808250427,"text_excerpt":"I can't say much about this place, other than their coffee is a life saver. Their iced coffee is delicious and full of flavor and the space itself is perfect if you want to get some work done, or just relax during a fun day in the Quarter. The staff is friendly and helpful and, although I didn't have any food on this stop, I will be returning to try some of their delicious offerings. I guess a place like this might be seen as a \"tourist trap\", but I think locals will enjoy it too."},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","review_id":"s4ygD_qhA0HSbj5DvJrLOA","date":"2017-10-22T21:33:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9308879375457764,"text_excerpt":"Stopped here to start our Sunday morning! Tried out the chicory coffee, Bavarian chocolate iced coffee, and raspberry white chocolate cookie. The coffees were pretty great, although the cookie was a little dry. At least one refill on coffee in a mug (I didn't ask for any more). The cookies are big and beautiful though, so I'll be up for trying another flavor on my next visit! Atmosphere was really nice and laid back, and they appear to have a pretty decent food menu and well stocked case of baked goods! Later in the day we stopped back in to get a Peppermint Schnapps mocha (all of their specialty coffee drinks sounded amazing! The Irish Coffee also looked really good!)."},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","review_id":"BR5vsnnhmid1iXmtxWb6Gw","date":"2015-08-18T18:09:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9264869689941406,"text_excerpt":"Yey! I love this place! I use to work across the street and I was highly addicted to their iced mochas and their Italian Cream sodas. Hey, guess what? They also have alcohol there! What smart café in the French Quarter wouldn't. Right? Cool atmosphere, great people. Can't go wrong with this place!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","photo_id":"tAtMRJ3pxRWR_r9av18h3Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tAtMRJ3pxRWR_r9av18h3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8604177832603455},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","photo_id":"K2RdHwYLOAGiEBO9oo4smQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/K2RdHwYLOAGiEBO9oo4smQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8543652892112732},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","photo_id":"gkPLW0AVkL5gGTNUs8dM1Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/gkPLW0AVkL5gGTNUs8dM1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8313764333724976},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","photo_id":"R9sT8nWCHI8VutU8oxvTIw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/R9sT8nWCHI8VutU8oxvTIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8164737224578857},{"business_id":"t1qF12NdW8KvCqxqbvy-Hg","photo_id":"mUONkt65oSO1GtXUKqHmqQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/mUONkt65oSO1GtXUKqHmqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8158640265464783}]},"notebook_case":null}
